cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the ecoregion layers, please cite the article and this archive as below."
type: software
title: "Code and data for: Multidecadal trends in phytoplankton biomass and phenology in Southern Ocean water masses"
abstract: >-
  R code and derived data used to build a hydrological ecoregionalization of the
  Southern Ocean from the bivariate functional PCA of temperature-salinity
  profiles (0-1000 m), and to estimate multidecadal trends (1998/99-2023/24) in
  phytoplankton biomass and phenology from ESA OC-CCI v6.0 satellite
  chlorophyll-a with functional data analysis and non-parametric trend
  estimation.
